<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<!-- $title = ST CATHERINE'S COLLEGE.txt -->
<!-- @import '../head.kit' -->

<body class="">
    <!-- @import '../header.kit' -->
    <div class="main">
        <div class="project-intro typewriter">
            <div class="project-intro-inner">
                <h1 class="project-title" data-chars="1" data-speed="50">St Catherine’s College WEB</h1>
                <hr>
                <div class="project-details-wrapper">
                    <div class="project-details">
                        <h2>Client</h2>
                        <p>St Catherine’s College</p>

                        <h2>Involvement</h2>
                        <p>Web Design</p>
                        <p>Web Development</p>
                        <p>Squarespace</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Challenge</h2>
                        <p>St Catherine’s College had a rich history and a strong offering for students, but needed a digital presence that reflected its new positioning as more than just a place to live.</p>
                        <p>We were tasked with bringing the refreshed brand to life online, creating a website that would communicate the premium, holistic experience of college life while making St Catherine’s feel modern, welcoming and aspirational to a new generation of students.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Solution</h2>
                        
                        <p>We translated the new St Catherine’s identity into a dynamic, heavily customised Squarespace website built around the idea of a student’s “first chapter”. Inspired by book spines and elements of the college crest, the visual language gives the website a distinctive sense of personality while creating a clear and intuitive experience for prospective residents.</p>
                        <p>Bold typography, editorial layouts and considered imagery work together to showcase the academic, social and personal sides of college life, shifting the focus from simply where students live to the community and experiences that shape who they become.</p>
                        <p><a href="https://www.stcats.com.au/" target="_blank" class="dotted after-arrow">Visit the website</a></p>
                        <div class="collab-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                            <img alt="Cameron Murray" title="Cameron Murray" src="/assets/logo-cameron-murray.svg">
                            <img alt="Block Branding" title="Block Branding" src="/assets/logo-block.svg">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-content">

            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/st-catherines-1.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/st-catherines-2.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/st-catherines-3.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/st-catherines-4.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/st-catherines-5.webp"></div>
            

        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- @import '../footer.kit' -->
</body>

</html>